@startuml F5.1-D02-refresh-manual
title F5.1-D02 — Refresh manual do dashboard
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "DashboardBFF" as BFF
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Refresh
note right of WebApp
  invalidateQueries
  + Skeleton
end note
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /bff/dashboard/secretary
Jwt -> BFF: JWT ok
BFF -> Postgres: queries
Postgres --> BFF: dados
BFF --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: dashboard atualizado

@enduml
